1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:05,760
You can make your own list of the instruments you watch most.

2
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:09,410
Click the plus button to start a new watchlist.

3
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:12,380
Give it a name.

4
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:15,710
Then click Create.

5
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:20,690
Your new list gets its own tab. It starts empty.

6
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:24,210
Go back to All to pick instruments.

7
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:26,270
To add an instrument, right click it and choose Add to Watchlist.

8
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:28,720
Then pick your list.

9
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:40,070
Add as many as you like.

10
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:44,430
Click the tab to see only your instruments.

11
00:00:44,530 --> 00:00:49,710
Prices here update live, just like the main list.

12
00:00:49,810 --> 00:00:52,710
Click All to go back to the full list.

